    topic_arn = aws_sns_topic.glacier_retrieval_topic.arn
    events    = ["s3:ObjectRestoreCompleted"]
  }
}

resource "aws_glacier_vault" "glacier_vault" {
  name = "my-glacier-vault"
}
```

This Terraform configuration ensures that:
- An S3 bucket (`my-glacier-vault-bucket`) is created to store Glacier vault data.
- An SNS topic (`glacier-retrieval-topic`) is created to receive notifications about archive retrieval completion.
- An IAM role (`s3-notification-role`) is created with a policy (`s3-notification-policy`) that allows S3 to publish to the SNS topic.
- The S3 bucket is configured to send notifications to the SNS topic when an object restore is completed.
- A Glacier vault (`my-glacier-vault`) is created and linked to the S3 bucket.

All resources are properly referenced and depend on each other as specified in the dependency graph.

